# ── MARK LIII — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
config/api_keys.json
config/certs/
config/whatsapp_web/
**/token*.json                # Google OAuth tokens (Gmail / Calendar plugins)
**/client_secret*.json        # Google OAuth client secrets
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Local backup/editor snapshots ────────────────────────────────────────────
*.backup
*.save
*.bak
*.before_router
*.prev.*
*.tmp

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/

# Cloud and agent runtime state. Keep personal task history, learned workflows,
# device identities, activity history, uploads, and result outboxes off Git.
cloud/tasks.json
cloud/devices.json
cloud/activity.json
automation/learning_memory.json
automation/engineering_memory.json
automation/permissions.json
uploads/
agent/mac_agent_outbox.json
